    "output": "<style>\n  .tablist { display: flex; gap: .25rem; border-bottom: 1px solid #e2e8f0; }\n  .tab {\n    padding: .6rem 1rem; border: none; background: transparent; cursor: pointer;\n    font-weight: 600; color: #64748b; border-bottom: 2px solid transparent; border-radius: 6px 6px 0 0;\n  }\n  .tab[aria-selected=\"true\"] { color: #2563eb; border-bottom-color: #2563eb; }\n  .tab:focus-visible { outline: 3px solid #2563eb; outline-offset: -2px; }\n  .tabpanel { padding: 1rem .25rem; color: #334155; }\n</style>\n<div>\n  <div class=\"tablist\" role=\"tablist\" aria-label=\"Account sections\">\n    <button class=\"tab\" role=\"tab\" id=\"tab-profile\" aria-selected=\"true\" aria-controls=\"panel-profile\" type=\"button\">Profile</button>\n    <button class=\"tab\" role=\"tab\" id=\"tab-billing\" aria-selected=\"false\" aria-controls=\"panel-billing\" tabindex=\"-1\" type=\"button\">Billing</button>\n    <button class=\"tab\" role=\"tab\" id=\"tab-api\" aria-selected=\"false\" aria-controls=\"panel-api\" tabindex=\"-1\" type=\"button\">API</button>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"tabpanel\" role=\"tabpanel\" id=\"panel-profile\" aria-labelledby=\"tab-profile\" tabindex=\"0\">Edit your profile details here.</div>\n  <div class=\"tabpanel\" role=\"tabpanel\" id=\"panel-billing\" aria-labelledby=\"tab-billing\" tabindex=\"0\" hidden>Invoices and payment methods.</div>\n  <div class=\"tabpanel\" role=\"tabpanel\" id=\"panel-api\" aria-labelledby=\"tab-api\" tabindex=\"0\" hidden>Manage API keys.</div>\n</div>"
