    "instruction": "Build a tooltip that appears on keyboard focus and is associated with its trigger using aria-describedby.",
    "output": "<style>\n  .tip { position: relative; display: inline-block; }\n  .tip .text {\n    position: absolute; bottom: calc(100% + 10px); left: 50%; transform: translateX(-50%);\n    background: #0f172a; color: #fff; padding: .4rem .7rem; border-radius: 6px;\n    font-size: .8rem; white-space: nowrap; opacity: 0; pointer-events: none; transition: opacity .15s;\n  }\n  .tip:focus-within .text { opacity: 1; }\n  .tip button { padding: .6rem 1rem; border: 1px solid #cbd5e1; border-radius: 8px; background: #fff; cursor: pointer; }\n  .tip button:focus-visible { outline: 3px solid #2563eb; outline-offset: 2px; }\n</style>\n<span class=\"tip\">\n  <button type=\"button\" aria-describedby=\"tip-help\">Keyboard shortcuts</button>\n  <span class=\"text\" role=\"tooltip\" id=\"tip-help\">Press Cmd+K anywhere</span>\n</span>"
