    "instruction": "Build a star rating input from radio buttons that is fully keyboard operable with a visible focus style on each star.",
    "output": "<style>\n  .rating { display: inline-flex; flex-direction: row-reverse; gap: .25rem; }\n  .rating input { position: absolute; opacity: 0; width: 1px; height: 1px; }\n  .rating label { font-size: 1.6rem; color: #cbd5e1; cursor: pointer; line-height: 1; }\n  .rating label:hover, .rating label:hover ~ label { color: #fbbf24; }\n  .rating input:checked ~ label { color: #f59e0b; }\n  .rating input:focus-visible + label { outline: 3px solid #2563eb; outline-offset: 2px; border-radius: 4px; }\n</style>\n<fieldset style=\"border:none;padding:0;\">\n  <legend style=\"font-size:.9rem;color:#334155;margin-bottom:.4rem;\">Rate your experience</legend>\n  <div class=\"rating\">\n    <input type=\"radio\" id=\"star5\" name=\"rating\" value=\"5\"><label for=\"star5\" aria-label=\"5 stars\">&#9733;</label>\n    <input type=\"radio\" id=\"star4\" name=\"rating\" value=\"4\"><label for=\"star4\" aria-label=\"4 stars\">&#9733;</label>\n    <input type=\"radio\" id=\"star3\" name=\"rating\" value=\"3\"><label for=\"star3\" aria-label=\"3 stars\">&#9733;</label>\n    <input type=\"radio\" id=\"star2\" name=\"rating\" value=\"2\"><label for=\"star2\" aria-label=\"2 stars\">&#9733;</label>\n    <input type=\"radio\" id=\"star1\" name=\"rating\" value=\"1\"><label for=\"star1\" aria-label=\"1 star\">&#9733;</label>\n  </div>\n</fieldset>"
